OL,4,CMiley Cyrus marries Maxx Morando in    
OL,5,CCalifornia ceremony                    
OL,6,GMiley Cyrus has married her partner of 
OL,7,Gfour years Maxx Morando during a       
OL,8,Gceremony in Palm Springs, California.  
OL,10,FPhotos of the wedding on Saturday show 
OL,11,Fthe ceremony took place by a swimming  
OL,12,Fpool with the pair standing under an   
OL,13,Farch covered in white flowers.         
OL,15,FThe singer's mother, Tish Cyrus, and   
OL,16,Fsister, Noah Cyrus, were in            
OL,17,Fattendance, Entertainment Tonight      
OL,18,Freported.                              
